  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin076-zhangkai:office" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin076-zhangkai:office:m0000" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA">元皇帝</persName>時，廷尉<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin076-zhangkai:office:m0007" ref="076_097_db5">張闓</persName></p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin076-zhangkai:kin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin076-zhangkai:kin:m0000" ref="076_097_db5">闓</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin076-zhangkai:kin:m0002" ref="076_097_db5">敬緒</persName>，丹陽人，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin076-zhangkai:kin:m0009" ref="roi_rz4_ute">張昭</persName>孫也。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin076-zhangkai:career" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin076-zhangkai:career:m0000" ref="076_097_db5">闓</persName>，晉陵內史，甚有威德。轉至廷尉卿。</p>
